{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Mystery Box: Hidden Secrets",
    "steam_appid": 1735790,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/eb198f765681d4943712817449a43951.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To unlock the boxes of this escape room game, you have to interact with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. You can find puzzle pieces on the side of the boxes as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/32ad8ac79e6beb8730d62278493aee2e.poster.avif?t=1751520187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/32ad8ac79e6beb8730d62278493aee2e.webm?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/32ad8ac79e6beb8730d62278493aee2e.mp4?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/b1c83b977c0078d366b0fddc5a5256c1.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>The illusion of holding a real object in total darkness is compelling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/b3e20d8cb6336c52a5c4b3c03fefdb09.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>Once you open all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and find a brief history of the discovered invention. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/5afffdd2cca186eebc25886f6ee61dc4.poster.avif?t=1751520187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/5afffdd2cca186eebc25886f6ee61dc4.webm?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/5afffdd2cca186eebc25886f6ee61dc4.mp4?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think outside of the box to solve all enigmas, it's not always an easy job to escape the rooms! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/a8a7f442f9ea68a066c9bbb42799c200.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/dd38af61a8155cd0922ec098244e6c92.poster.avif?t=1751520187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/dd38af61a8155cd0922ec098244e6c92.webm?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/dd38af61a8155cd0922ec098244e6c92.mp4?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/0f7fdbf2ea49b96d78ff169f9494b094.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the game with your headphones on to get immersed in this amazing adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/d1bf53d3c3a4ef283ff9a44653870575.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>Got stuck on some riddle? Tap the bulb button to get a helpful hint! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/da31888562d4b38cb6876cb1b6355d01.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>Available in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*The game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/f221e128dbdeaebe6f4bbf6c8f11e2ae.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>Hi there, <strong>Frank\u00a0Eno</strong>\u00a0here. I have been creating escape room and puzzle games since 2020 under the name of\u00a0<strong>XSGames</strong>, doing everything\u00a0myself: code, graphics, music, design, concept, etc.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/eb198f765681d4943712817449a43951.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To unlock the boxes of this escape room game, you have to interact with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. You can find puzzle pieces on the side of the boxes as well. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/32ad8ac79e6beb8730d62278493aee2e.poster.avif?t=1751520187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/32ad8ac79e6beb8730d62278493aee2e.webm?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/32ad8ac79e6beb8730d62278493aee2e.mp4?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/b1c83b977c0078d366b0fddc5a5256c1.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>The illusion of holding a real object in total darkness is compelling!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/b3e20d8cb6336c52a5c4b3c03fefdb09.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>Once you open all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and find a brief history of the discovered invention. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/5afffdd2cca186eebc25886f6ee61dc4.poster.avif?t=1751520187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/5afffdd2cca186eebc25886f6ee61dc4.webm?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/5afffdd2cca186eebc25886f6ee61dc4.mp4?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think outside of the box to solve all enigmas, it's not always an easy job to escape the rooms! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/a8a7f442f9ea68a066c9bbb42799c200.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/dd38af61a8155cd0922ec098244e6c92.poster.avif?t=1751520187\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/dd38af61a8155cd0922ec098244e6c92.webm?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/dd38af61a8155cd0922ec098244e6c92.mp4?t=1751520187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/0f7fdbf2ea49b96d78ff169f9494b094.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the game with your headphones on to get immersed in this amazing adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/d1bf53d3c3a4ef283ff9a44653870575.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>Got stuck on some riddle? Tap the bulb button to get a helpful hint! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/da31888562d4b38cb6876cb1b6355d01.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>Available in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*The game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1735790/extras/f221e128dbdeaebe6f4bbf6c8f11e2ae.avif?t=1751520187\" data-has-big /></div>Hi there, <strong>Frank\u00a0Eno</strong>\u00a0here. I have been creating escape room and puzzle games since 2020 under the name of\u00a0<strong>XSGames</strong>, doing everything\u00a0myself: code, graphics, music, design, concept, etc.</p>",
